    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36101" root="قلت" body-key="q">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَقْلَنَةٌ</span></b>  <i>A place of perdition</i> or <i>destruction</i> or
<i>death;</i> (S, O, Msb, K;) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَقْلَتٌ</span></b> . (MF.)
And hence, <i>A desert,</i> or <i>waterless desert.</i> (Msb.)
And <i>A place that is feared.</i> (TA.)

